th Alexander\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"","src":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/productivity-vs-time-consumption.png?w=350&h=200&crop=1","width":350,"height":200},"classes":[]},{"id":749,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2012\/01\/15\/dancer-controlling-sound-with-sensors-idea-sketch\/","url_meta":{"origin":39,"position":4},"title":"Dancer controlling sound with sensors &#8211; Idea sketch","date":"January 15, 2012","format":false,"excerpt":"(...) a sensor based setup for a dancer and a drummer, where the dancer can pick up sounds played by the drummer and process them with movement (...) My project description What: Dancer wearing sensors - controlling sound. The idea is that the dancer can approach my drum set (sound\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"","src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2012\/01\/lydplukking-e1368445521324.jpg?fit=896%2C1200&ssl=1&resize=350%2C200","width":350,"height":200},"classes":[]},{"id":401,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2011\/11\/01\/dancers\/","url_meta":{"origin":39,"position":5},"title":"Dancers","date":"November 1, 2011","format":false,"excerpt":"As stated in my project description: - Look at the possibilities for at external sources, such as the audience, a net stream, dancers, humidity, lights etc. can control the development in the music and in the video trough out a performance by using alternative sensors, controllers and programs. I want\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"","src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2013\/05\/p401.jpg?fit=1200%2C675&ssl=1&resize=350%2C200","width":350,"height":200},"classes":[]}],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/39"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about"